# Troubleshooting License Activation Issues

## Overview

If license activation fails, the issue is typically related to connectivity, DNS resolution, firewall rules, or proxy configuration.

Carbonio licensing requires outbound HTTPS communication with the Zextras licensing API.

| Endpoint | api.zextras.io |
|---|---|
| Protocol | HTTPS |
| Port | TCP 443 |

---

## Step 1 — Verify DNS Resolution

Check that the server can resolve the licensing endpoint.

```bash
nslookup api.zextras.io
